menuconfig MODULES_FLIP_RIG_PITCH
	bool "flip_rig_pitch"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for flip_rig_pitch

		Standalone, manually-started single-shot 360 degree pitch flip
		controller for a fixture that physically prevents translation
		(e.g. a 3-axis gimbal/gyroscope test rig). Never touches position/
		GPS - start with `flip_rig_pitch start` and do not run it alongside
		another OFFBOARD-publishing module. The instant OFFBOARD is
		engaged, it latches the vehicle's current yaw, executes exactly
		one 360 degree pitch rotation via raw body-rate setpoints, then
		commands a level attitude at the latched yaw and holds it.
